#: data/maps/Route114_FossilManiacsHouse/scripts.inc:33
msgctxt "Route114_FossilManiacsHouse_Text_HaveThisToDigLikeMyBrother"
msgid ""
"My big brother's the FOSSIL MANIAC…\n"
"He's a nice guy who loves FOSSILS…\p"
"He loves digging holes, too…\n"
"He dug this hole by himself…\p"
"You can have this, so you can DIG\n"
"holes just like my big brother…$"
msgstr ""
"我哥哥是个化石迷……\n"
"他是个喜欢化石的好人……\p"
"他也很喜欢挖洞……\n"
"这个洞是他自己挖的……\p"
"这个给你，\n"
"这样你就能像我哥哥一样挖洞了……$"

#: data/maps/Route114_FossilManiacsHouse/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "Route114_FossilManiacsHouse_Text_DigReturnsYouToEntrance"
msgid ""
"If you make a POKéMON DIG inside a\n"
"cave, you're returned to the entrance…$"
msgstr ""
"在洞窟里让宝可梦使用挖洞，\n"
"就能回到入口……$"

#: data/maps/Route114_FossilManiacsHouse/scripts.inc:45
msgctxt "Route114_FossilManiacsHouse_Text_RocksFillDisplayCase"
msgid ""
"Rocks in peculiar shapes fill\n"
"the display case…$"
msgstr "展示柜里摆满了形状奇特的岩石……$"

#: data/maps/Route114_FossilManiacsHouse/scripts.inc:49
msgctxt "Route114_FossilManiacsHouse_Text_CrammedWithBooks"
msgid ""
"THE COMPOSITION OF STRATA…\n"
"HOW RAIN SHAPES THE LAND…\l"
"STONES, SOIL, AND ROCK…\p"
"It's crammed with books.$"
msgstr ""
"《地层的构成》……《雨水如何塑造大\n"
"地》……《石头、泥土与岩石》……\p"
"书架上塞满了书。$"
